1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:06,446
Myth or fact? A twenty-five percent markup means a twenty-five percent margin.

2
00:00:06,566 --> 00:00:11,550
Cost AED 100. You sell at AED 125.

3
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:15,969
Is the margin 25, 20 or 30 percent?

4
00:00:18,489 --> 00:00:21,112
It's 20 percent. So, myth.

5
00:00:21,232 --> 00:00:24,207
Same AED 25 of profit.

6
00:00:24,327 --> 00:00:27,306
Divide by cost: markup.

7
00:00:27,426 --> 00:00:30,462
Divide by price: margin.

8
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:34,768
For a 25% margin, mark up by 33.3%.

9
00:00:34,888 --> 00:00:40,403
Our accounting & MIS advisory keeps the two apart.

10
00:00:40,523 --> 00:00:43,724
Comment your answer, or send us a WhatsApp.
